// Regression: ~60 KB POST body (eth_call with ~30 KB input data).
// Pins fix for HttpPayload::get_slice() returning only the first 16 KB chunk
// of a multi-chunk body, which used to surface as HTTP 400 / Parse error: invalid JSON.
// Calling into the empty zero address returns 0x (no contract code).
>> {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "eth_call", "params": [{"to": "0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000", "data": ""}, "latest"]}
<< {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": "0x"}
